# the build context is app/; the image needs pyproject.toml, VERSION, MANIFEST.in, the license
# files, docs/proxy.md, proxy/, chatd/ and its launcher ops/chatd.sh (OPS-250), tandemapp/, packages/,
# the build backend, the bundle tool
# and the dashboard's sources (its Node stage builds dashboard/dist, OPS-246) only
*
!pyproject.toml
!VERSION
!MANIFEST.in
!LICENSE
!COMMERCIAL-LICENSE.md
!NOTICE
!docs/proxy.md
!proxy/
!chatd/
!ops/chatd.sh
!tandemapp/
!packages/
!packaging/tandemapp_build.py
!tools/dashboard_bundle.py
!dashboard/
dashboard/node_modules
dashboard/dist
dashboard/e2e-artifacts
dashboard/e2e-report
dashboard/e2e-results.json
dashboard/e2e-chat-panes-artifacts
dashboard/e2e-chat-panes-results.json
dashboard/screenshots
dashboard/.vite
**/__pycache__
